 "details": {
  "evt-cQE6HSoYAsRauAk": {
   "description_mirror": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "An Evening of AI Creation: Horror Demo Night",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "bold"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": " of ",
        "type": "text"
       },
       {
        "text": "Generathon #3",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "bold"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": "⚡",
        "type": "text"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "This evening is especially for people curious to see what's possible when you give visionary creators and developers just 24 hours to redefine generative AI.",
        "type": "text"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "Brought to you by ",
        "type": "text"
       },
       {
        "text": "Le Motif",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
           "href": "https://www.instagram.com/levraimotif/"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": ", an AI creative & content creator, and by ",
        "type": "text"
       },
       {
        "text": "roland.builds",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
           "href": "https://www.instagram.com/roland.builds/"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": ", the Generathon is the place to be, where AI artists, video creators, and storytellers come together to push what's possible when creativity meets frontier models.",
        "type": "text"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "Teams have been competing all weekend to build the future of AI creativity. The absolute best of them will be presenting their work live on stage across two categories: Three Minutes to Scare - Short horror film format, and Sell the Fear - Ad format.",
        "type": "text"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "The content you'll see is packed with spooky surprises and creepy vibes. If you scare easily, this is your official cue to turn back 🙀",
        "type": "text"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
       {
        "text": "(Want to build instead of just watching? The actual Generathon runs from Saturday to Sunday. ",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "italic"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": "[",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "italic"
         },
         {
          "type": "bold"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "text": "Click here to register as a participant!",
        "type": "text",
        "marks": [
         {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
           "href": "https://luma.com/leomxba2?utm_source=luma_demo_night"
          }
         },
         {
